      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For executive presence, look for candidates who exude genuine confidence, demonstrate exceptional self-awareness, and maintain poised composure under pressure. Regarding commanding authority, prioritize those who communicate with clarity, decisiveness, and strategic vision, irrespective of the audience. Effective leaders blend these traits by making clear decisions while inspiring confidence in their teams. Ultimately, you are seeking a combination of gravitas and actionable charisma.",
